{"type":"message","id":"77d49c64","parentId":"d7baaaf9","timestamp":"2026-04-25T13:20:49.393Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户现在需要我根据本周做的事情填写飞书文档，首先我得先读取这个文档的内容对吧？首先调用feishu_fetch_doc工具，把这个文档的内容拿下来，看看需要填什么部分，然后再去查本周的相关记录，比如memory里的本周日志，还有之前做的事情。首先第一步就是获取文档内容，所以先调用feishu_fetch_doc，参数是doc_id就是那个链接对吧，工具支持自动解析URL的，所以直接传链接就行。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ljpzsvujbzruh9pyisjyitw5","name":"feishu_fetch_doc","arguments":{"doc_id":"https://jcneyh7qlo8i.feishu.cn/wiki/EcWLwx2eBiflWskQy0LcgpLPnFb?from=from_copylink"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-pro","usage":{"input":31692,"output":190,"cacheRead":4920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36802,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777123239880,"responseId":"chatcmpl-aca15de5-a78e-4b33-ac26-09334903c30d"}}
